* LT3045-1 3.3V LDO Regulator
.lib LT3045-1.sub

V1 IN 0 5
Cin IN 0 10u
Cout OUT 0 10u

* 100mA load at 3.3V
Rload OUT 0 33

* Current limit set to ~500mA
Rilim ILIM 0 400

* Set pin resistor for 3.3V output (100uA * 33k = 3.3V)
Rset SET 0 33k

* Set pin capacitor required for stability and noise reduction
* Note: 4.7uF with 100uA charges in ~155ms, requiring a >155ms tran simulation
Cset SET 0 4.7u

* LT3045-1 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pin order: IN, EN/UV, PG, ILIM, VIOC, SET, GND, OUTS, OUT
X1 IN IN NC_PG ILIM 0 SET 0 OUT OUT LT3045-1

* Transient analysis long enough to allow the 4.7uF SET capacitor to fully charge
.tran 250m
.end
